  "goodToKnow": "Die Seuche is an epidemic or plague: die Pest war die schlimmste Seuche des Mittelalters, the Black Death killed perhaps a third of Europe's population in the 14th century. Today, Tierseuchen (animal epidemics) like Afrikanische Schweinepest and Vogelgrippe are a big issue in German farming. Figuratively, eine Seuche is a scourge: Fake News sind eine Seuche. Plural: die Seuchen."
